'''Doll Cats Awake!''' (開眼のひなにゃんこ襲来！''Kaigan no Hina Nyanko Shūrai!'', '''Awakened Doll Cats Attack!''') introduces the [[True Form]] of [[Doll Cats (Rare Cat)|Doll Cats]] - Nyalladin. This event was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

